Group B (>5): pixels = [6,6,6,6,7,7,7] →7 pixels.

Sum_B = 6*4 +7*3 = 24 +21=45 → μ_B = 45/7 ≈6.4286

w_A = 5/12, w_B =7/12

σ_b^2 = (5/12)(7/12)(2.4 - 6.4286)^2

